\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 There are other universes in which electrified guitars and upright basses were classified in law as weapons of mass distraction, and there were jurisdictions that required security systems to scan for the mere presence of  those musical instruments, along with all accessories such as cases, strings, gaff tape and even some brands of furniture polish.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Which was fortunate for the Elvi in our account who, after dispatching Chanta, the Great Teacher back to the city while they carried out the High Elvis\'92s supplementary orders, which were to carry on and keep raiding mansions for Gyges discs until either the the sun came up or autograph-seeking crowds made robbing-on impossible.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Some targets were easier than others. One mansion\'92s security opened the gates and service entrances within twelve bars of a rockabilly version of \'93Joshua Hit the Battle with a Stereo\'94, then offered coffee.\
That same night, officers at the local TRAMPS station fell asleep at their desks and\'97literally, in one case\'97at the wheel, because, earlier in the shift, the station coffee machine had to be rebooted after classifying itself as evidence. It took until nearly dawn, when the kookaburras were having their first laugh, for the station\'92s cleaning crew to notice security footage in the media room from the mansions and traffic cameras. At first, they thought they were  watching some travelling Elvis tribute show until they noticed the hijinks the Elvi were up to inside the mansions. The sleeping shift of law enforcers were duly poked awake with the dry ends of wet mops.\
As the morning progressed, the TRAMPS station was swamped with calls from journos, gossip show hosts and the occasional psychic medium asking about everything\'97names, numbers, licence plates, hair stylists and favourite jumpsuits.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

